# Run 384 evidence archive — only README.md, summary.txt, and .gitignore are tracked.
# All per-run artifacts contain absolute paths and ephemeral data and MUST NOT be committed.
# Node data dirs, node logs, raw /metrics scrape dumps, and the generated manifest.json are
# temporary and dev-only; only publish-safe hashes and status lines appear in the tracked
# summary/README. The committed, publish-safe example manifest lives at
# docs/release/public-devnet/binary/RELEASE_ARTIFACT_MANIFEST.example.json.
node-data/
nodes/
logs/
data/
manifest.json
clean_metrics.txt
metrics.txt
*.metrics
*.err
*.log
*.metrics.txt
manifest.metrics.txt
